<title>HUNGARY: Budapest to list 90,000 more Human shares.</title>
<headline>Budapest to list 90,000 more Human shares.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Budapest Stock Exchange (BSE) is to list an additional 90,000 ordinary shares of drug maker Human Rt, with effect from next Monday, the BSE said in its official gazette on Thursday.</p>
<p>The shares, which have been converted from employee shares, each have a face value of 1,000 forints, the BSE said.</p>
<p>Human already has 2,710,000 ordinary shares in issue. The share closed at 2,700 forints on the BSE on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327 4040</p>
</text>
